  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Simple 32-bit watchdog timer from Efabless/ChipFoundry. Loadable down-counter decremented every system clock cycle; raises TO (timeout) IRQ on zero and reloads. Bark-only (IRQ on timeout \u2014 no integrated bite-reset). APB / AHB-Lite / Wishbone wrappers. For full bark+bite production WDT, prefer opentitan-aon-timer.",
